ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nXiao Qiang is in junior high school this year. This morning, he rushes out the door and forgets to bring his homework. He tells Teacher Li about this situation, but considering that he often fails to hand in or misses homework, and his grades are not very good, Teacher Li thinks he is lying.\n\n[Question]\nHow does Xiao Qiang convince Teacher Li that he really does not bring his homework?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Xiao Qiang takes out his backpack, shows the contents of his backpack to Teacher Li, proving that he really does not bring his homework.\nB. Xiao Qiang tells Teacher Li that he is willing to redo the homework after school or during the break, to prove his true intentions.\nC. Xiao Qiang can suggest that after school, he invites Teacher Li to his house to check the homework book, proving that he indeed does the homework.\nD. Xiao Qiang provides photos or videos of doing homework the night before as evidence.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0015011222376445476,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e13ed6006945d27feb34","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367806244,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:30:06","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"81c518db6dca4415bdd58407a142190d"}